{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10462","headline":"画马篇 · 高适","name":"画马篇","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"君侯枥上骢，貌在丹青中。\n马毛连钱蹄铁色，图画光辉骄玉勒。\n马行不动势若来，权奇蹴踏无尘埃。\n感兹绝代称妙手，遂令谈者不容口。\n麒麟独步自可珍，驽骀万匹知何有，终未如他枥上骢。\n载华毂，聘飞鸿，荷君剪拂与君用，一日千里如旋风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10462.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10462","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}